\section*{Appendix K. Complete exploratory aggregate-panel outputs and prospective protocol}
The fourteen candidate keys were fixed from current official net-position metadata before financial outcomes. Twelve supply the complete original 706-date grid; PDPOSGSC-G11L21 and PDPOSGSC-G21 lack 457 required dates each. No series was spliced, interpolated or chosen by forecast performance. Each provenance file records actual URL, acquisition time, response hash and reporting-era metadata; raw input access code is supplied. The labels and reporting structure can change across eras, so continuity of a key and a complete calendar alone do not establish economic measurement invariance. There is no pooled independence-based significance claim across these related aggregate series.

